cpufreq: sun50i-cpufreq-nvmem: map the H700 speed bin 0x6c00 to a5

The H700 fuses 0x6c00, which this driver does not know and so falls
back to bin a0.  Mainline maps it to speed bin 5 with its own voltage
set (see the a5 entries in the board DTS).

--- a/drivers/cpufreq/sun50i-cpufreq-nvmem.c
+++ b/drivers/cpufreq/sun50i-cpufreq-nvmem.c
@@ -122,6 +122,10 @@
 	case 0x5c00:
 		value = 4;
 		break;
+	case 0x6c00:
+		/* H700, as mainline's speed5 */
+		value = 5;
+		break;
 	case 0x5d00:
 	default:
 		value = 0;
